# Build outputs
# Anchored with a leading slash. Unanchored, "lib/" matches a directory of that
# name at any depth, which silently excluded src/lib/ -- six source files that had
# never been committed, so the package did not typecheck on a fresh clone. Found
# the day CI started running its typecheck.
/lib/
/dist/
node_modules/








